  "answer_chosen_at": null,
  "upvotes": 1,
  "body": "There may be an issue w/ the [FedRAMP Schema Validator](https://www.fedramp.gov/schemas/validator/?schema=fedramp-security-decision-record-schema-2026-06-24.json) processing valid SDRs. The validator returns `no schema with key or ref \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\"` which suggests the validator is unable to resolve the draft 2020-12 meta-schema.\r\n\r\nLocal testing by multiple parties using valid SDRs pass successfully.",
  "comment_count": 1,
