      "upvotes": 1,
      "minimized": false,
      "body": "Hi @gmengelberg - thank you for the heads up, we're tracking this error but haven't prioritized fixing as the schema on the website is provided for convenience. Sounds like you've already separately validated so you should be good!\r\n\r\nHopefully we'll have the web validator updated soon, and we'll also be sure to add a disclaimer that it shouldn't be relied on for any production use.",
